This directory contains some silly example files.  All of the
executable ones are Remind or shell scripts.

alignment:  Demonstrates how pad() can be used for text alignment.
ansitext:   Shows off some ANSI text attributes.
astro:      Astronomical events.  Edit to set your latitude and longitude.
cflag:      Prints a flag.  Make sure terminal is at least 90x24.
defs.rem:   Some sample Remind definitions.  Mostly obsoleted by include/ files.
markup:     A demo of the FMT markup.
remind.vim: A syntax file for vim.
tflag:      Prints a differenf flag.

